---
title: How a submitted message finds its current owner
---
flowchart TB
  D["Typing or dictating • remember the focused question ID<br/>Silence changes nothing"] -->|Send or explicit finish-and-send| I["Kernel records message ID, chat sequence and reply target"]
  STOP["Stop button or explicit stop command"] --> CANCEL["Kernel fences dispatch and cancels scoped active work"]
  I --> Q{"Answer to an open question?"}
  Q -->|Live ID and unambiguous item| ARB["Question queue binds reply, resolves evidence and notifies subscribed owners"]
  Q -->|Other text or retired question| SEED["Resolve explicit feature or selected node<br/>Else search project aliases, referenced turns and pending routes"]
  SEED --> CARD["Small read-only router receives short candidate cards<br/>Returns clause intents, candidate IDs and supporting evidence"]
  CARD --> VALID{"Kernel validates current IDs, permissions and reference evidence"}
  VALID -->|Ambiguous subject| ASK["Widen by one typed neighborhood<br/>If unresolved, queue a named question"]
  ASK --> Q
  VALID -->|General question| READ["Read assignment, test or action receipts with timestamps<br/>Reply while workers continue"]
  VALID -->|Feature change or addition| OWNER["Look up stable owner role, then current leased planner<br/>Unowned or shared scope goes to project planner"]
  VALID -->|Control| CTRL["Kernel checks target and command before changing run state"]
  OWNER --> MAIL["Deliver to role inbox at next turn boundary<br/>Recheck role and epoch before writes"]
  subgraph RECORDS["Indexed project records"]
    ROLE["Planner role for kitchen orders"] -->|held by| A["A0007 • leased session"]
    ROLE -->|authored| B["T08 brief and contract versions"]
    B -->|executed as| W["A0014 • assignment, epoch and checkpoint"]
  end
  ROLE -.-> OWNER
  W -.-> READ
